// METHOD
// ------
// TRUE Gaussian Maximum Likelihood Classification.
//
// For every class:
//
//   - 9-band class mean vector
//   - sample covariance matrix
//   - diagonal regularization = 1e-6
//   - covariance determinant
//   - covariance inverse
//
// Gaussian discriminant:
//
//   g_c(x) =
//       -0.5 * ln(|Sigma_c|)
//       -0.5 * (x - mu_c)' Sigma_c^-1 (x - mu_c)
//
// Equal priors are used.
//
// The common:
//   -0.5 * k * ln(2*pi)
//
// term and equal-prior term can be omitted because they are identical
// for every class and therefore do not affect argmax.
//
// IMPORTANT
// ---------
